    "source": {
      "goCharacterKey": "YumemizukiMizuki",
      "note": "Generated from Genshin Optimizer sheets (master) + allStat_gen skillParam. Hit keys match GO target paths; multKey = <hitKey>_mult. Levels: Lv10, except constellation-boosted talents of 4-star characters at Lv13 (C6 assumed). Normal/charged/plunging default to physical unless the sheet overrides the element (infusions are NOT applied). Unparsed GO formulas (add manually if needed): ['burst.snackHeal: skipped (helper/cond formula)', 'skill.swirl_dmg_: skipped (helper/cond formula)'].\n\n2026-08-07 re-check against nanoka 6.7.54 (https://static.nanoka.cc/gi/6.7.54/en/character/10000109.json) after her rework: base stats and EVERY Lv10 damage multiplier above are byte-identical to the live data, so the rework changed no damage numbers. What it added is Stellar Swirl, which this evaluator does not implement: the skill gained a second EM-scaling line (Stellar Swirl DMG +0.045% per EM point alongside Swirl's 0.45%), passive4 'Vast Be the Dream' gained a Radiance: Stellar Swirl clause, C1 gained a Stellar Swirl branch (+550% EM vs Swirl's +1100%), and C6 gained Stellar Swirl crit. Those values are recorded in the skill/constellation blocks above but have no hit definitions or modifiers.\n\nALSO NOT MODELLED: her core skill buff 'Swirl DMG +0.45% per point of HER EM' (swirl_dmg_per_eleMas) needs a swirl_dmg_from_eleMas conversion that does not exist -- and it must read Mizuki's EM, not the scored character's, so it would need the statInput treatment rather than a plain conversion; C1's flat EM-scaled Swirl DMG increase; C6's fixed-crit Swirl (the batch evaluator's crit_kinds set excludes swirl_reaction, so a swirl rotation target cannot crit at all yet); passive4's enhanced periodic Anemo DMG at 1000% EM. The two team buffs that ARE now modelled (passive4's 10% EM share and C2's per-EM elemental DMG bonus) use the statInput mechanism, since both scale off Mizuki's own EM.",
      "assumptions": {
        "constellation": 0,
        "characterLevel": 90,
        "autoTalentLevel": 10,
        "skillTalentLevel": 10,
        "burstTalentLevel": 10
      }
    }
  },
